sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Cluster Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as openshift-kueue-operator<br/>ns: openshift-kueue-operator
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Controller as kueue-controller-manager<br/>ns: kueue-system
    participant VisAPI as Visibility API<br/>8082/TCP
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Metrics: 8443/TCP

    Note over Admin,Prometheus: Flow 1: Operator Reconciliation

    Admin->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Kueue CR<br/>(kueue.openshift.io/v1)
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Watch notification
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply kueue-controller-manager Deployment
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply RBAC (ClusterRoles, Bindings)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply Webhook Configurations (35 total)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply CRDs (13 Kueue CRDs)
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply cert-manager Certificate CRs
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Apply ServiceMonitors
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Reconciliation complete

    Note over Admin,Prometheus: Flow 2: Workload Admission (failurePolicy: Fail)

    participant User as Data Scientist
    User->>K8sAPI: Create Job/PyTorchJob/RayCluster<br/>(with queue label)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /mutate-batch-v1-job<br/>443→9443/TCP TLS<br/>Kubernetes admission auth
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated (queue labels injected)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate-batch-v1-job<br/>443→9443/TCP TLS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admitted / Rejected
    K8sAPI-->>User: Workload created

    Note over Controller,K8sAPI: Flow 3: Queue Processing

    Controller->>K8sAPI: Watch Workloads, ClusterQueues, LocalQueues
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Workload pending
    Controller->>Controller: Evaluate quota against ClusterQueue
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Admit workload (update status)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Unsuspend Job/PyTorchJob

    Note over Prometheus,Controller: Flow 4: Monitoring

    Prometheus->>Controller: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    Controller-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics

    Note over Admin,VisAPI: Flow 5: Visibility API

    Admin->>K8sAPI: GET /apis/visibility.kueue.x-k8s.io/...<br/>pendingworkloads
    K8sAPI->>VisAPI: API aggregation<br/>443→8082/TCP
    VisAPI-->>K8sAPI: Pending workload status
    K8sAPI-->>Admin: Response
